OL,3,GNEWSARescuers say TikTok and Instagram
OL,4,Aposts don't prepare hikers for dangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media posts on TikTok and
OL,7,FInstagram show the beauty of wild
OL,8,Fplaces without warning about the danger
OL,9,Fwalkers can face, mountain rescuers
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,F"Too many people influenced by these
OL,13,Fposts are ending up in the mountains
OL,14,Funprepared," said Nick Phillips from
OL,15,FMountain Rescue England and Wales
OL,16,F(MREW).
OL,18,FIt recorded emergencies involving 18 to
OL,19,F24-year-olds almost doubled from
OL,20,F2019-2024, with the four largest teams
OL,21,Fin Wales all on track for record high
OL,22,Fcall outs in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
