OL,3,GNEWSARescuers say TikTok and Instagram
OL,4,Aposts don't prepare hikers for dangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team responsible for Wales' tallest
OL,7,Fmountain said the pressure on
OL,8,Fvolunteers was "unsustainable", a
OL,9,Fconcern echoed by the team near Brecon
OL,10,Fthat said demand "keeps rising".
